Z||000003||mrfiero||10-24-2001||12:00 AM||||No offense to anyone, but I personally would not pay more than $1500 for a near 100K mile '85 GT.  There are literally a TON of these out there and more than a few with low miles.  95K miles isn't bad, but I have seen 20-40K mile examples selling for $3000-$5000.  For my money (if I were in the market for an '85 GT) I would get a lower mileage one if at all possible.    ||||reg||1
